
$help
[Commands]
ver    - Print Shell version
hello  - Print "Hello world!"
quit , q , exit - Exit from Shell
delay <ms> - Wait some time 
back <count> - leave X directories
clv    - Clear view
clh    - Clear Terminal History
cd  <path_to_folder> - Enter in the folder
histexport <name> - export Shell History file
set-lng <language file name> - Sets language file to file in program folder
if <arg1> <operator> <arg2> - Make logic if
future <Count_Of_commands_To_execute> <Command> - execute command after X commands

[Variable Manipulations]

#<Variable_Name> - Replace string to variable Value

var <Variable_Name> = <Value> - Create variable
rvar <Variable_Name> - Delete variable
varlist - Show all variables

$

